# Fearless Swashbuckler (3/3 Fish Pirate, haste; "Vehicles you control have haste"): "whenever you attack, if a Pirate and a Vehicle attacked this
# combat" needs both. On turn one Bot1 casts it and an Air Response Unit (a Vehicle) and attacks with the Pirate alone: no cards are drawn
# (Bot2 17). On turn three the Vehicle, crewed by Memnite, attacks alone (the Swashbuckler stays home): again nothing is drawn beyond the turn's
# own draw (Bot2 14). The haste is Bot1's: Bot2's own Air Response Unit, cast and crewed on turn four, cannot attack (it has summoning sickness)
# although Bot2 has another creature that could attack, so the declaration is asked and the Vehicle refused.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Air Response Unit
Fearless Swashbuckler
Memnite
Island
Forest
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Air Response Unit
Memnite
Memnite
Island x3
Island x10

